# NOTE: .env is intentionally NOT globally ignored.
# On the `vulnerable` branch a demo .env with FAKE secrets is committed on purpose
# to demonstrate the "exposed .env / secret in repo" vulnerability (detected by Gitleaks
# in the secure pipeline). On the `secure` branch, .env is ignored — see that branch's .gitignore.
